text:
Looking for Coeliac/Celiacs to complete a survey Hey everyone, My name is Stephan and I'm from Sydney Australia. I'm doing some research on Coeliac Disease and I'm looking for help from people living with this condition (whether it's you or a member of your family).

My research involves understanding the problem(s) Coeliacs face when travelling and eating-out. I've prepared a simple survey and need volunteers to complete it. The link: [https://goo.gl/forms/Lzoei7Adz2SekSGp2](https://goo.gl/forms/Lzoei7Adz2SekSGp2) and check out my facebook page called Xper Design

&amp;#x200B;
